WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:05.747
Ivy lay in bed propped up on pillows.

2
00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:09.627
Smiling happily, she drew in her sketch pad.

3
00:00:09.628 --> 00:00:12.940
It was her second day in the camp infirmary.

4
00:00:12.941 --> 00:00:16.749
"This is fantastic!" Ivy thought.

5
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.753
"I can spend all my time drawing my graphic novel."

6
00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:24.465
Across the room Annie was in bed, coughing.

7
00:00:24.466 --> 00:00:29.281
Ivy looked over at her. "How are you feeling?"

8
00:00:29.282 --> 00:00:31.619
Annie blew her nose.

9
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.963
"Not so good." Annie's nose was red.

10
00:00:35.964 --> 00:00:40.497
Her eyes were puffy. "How about you?"

11
00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:46.786
Ivy chuckled. "How am I feeling? I've never felt better."

12
00:00:46.787 --> 00:00:51.651
Ivy knew her secret was safe because Annie was really nice.

13
00:00:51.652 --> 00:00:55.608
Besides, there was one good thing about this camp.

14
00:00:55.609 --> 00:00:58.973
The campers rarely told on each other.

15
00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:02.270
Nurse Kramer walked in.

16
00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:05.302
Ivy hid her sketch pad under the pillow.

17
00:01:05.303 --> 00:01:08.635
She closed her eyes and moaned.

18
00:01:08.636 --> 00:01:13.717
Nurse Kramer stopped at Annie's bed first and took her temperature.

19
00:01:13.718 --> 00:01:16.630
"You still have a fever, Annie."

20
00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:20.439
She handed Annie some pills and a glass of water.

21
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.967
"These should make you feel better."

22
00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:28.413
Then she turned to Ivy. "Time for your check-in."

23
00:01:28.414 --> 00:01:32.679
Nurse Kramer held a thermometer up to Ivy's forehead.

24
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:38.159
She looked at the screen. "You still don't have a fever."

25
00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:45.799
"My head hurts, and my throat is really sore." Ivy moaned.

26
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:53.079
"I ache all over. I definitely need to stay here for a few more days."

27
00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:59.337
"Hmm. Well, okay." Nurse Kramer looked closely at her.

28
00:01:59.338 --> 00:02:03.201
"If you feel that bad, just lie here and rest."

29
00:02:03.202 --> 00:02:08.591
Ivy pulled up her covers. "Okay, that's what I'll do."

30
00:02:08.592 --> 00:02:12.830
"Do you feel like chatting with some visitors?" Nurse Kramer asked.

31
00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:16.346
"Your friends Ezra and Glen are outside."

32
00:02:16.347 --> 00:02:20.360
"I guess I can manage that," Ivy said weakly.

33
00:02:20.361 --> 00:02:23.889
"Maybe for just a few minutes."

34
00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.822
"You'll have to talk to them through the window," the nurse said.

35
00:02:27.823 --> 00:02:31.324
"We can't spread germs, can we?"

36
00:02:31.325 --> 00:02:35.639
Nurse Kramer left the room, and Ivy went to the open window.

37
00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.879
Ezra and Glen were standing outside.

38
00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:42.823
"Hi, what's up?" Ivy grinned.

39
00:02:42.824 --> 00:02:45.158
Glen had his hands on his hips.

40
00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.353
He glared at her.

41
00:02:47.354 --> 00:02:51.803
"Ivy, how long are you going to fake being sick?"

42
00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:56.454
"We really need you back on the Yellow team," Ezra said.

43
00:02:56.455 --> 00:03:03.335
"Maybe we could win if we practice. Don't you want ice cream?"

44
00:03:03.336 --> 00:03:07.401
Ivy laughed. "Guess what?

45
00:03:07.402 --> 00:03:11.553
Nurse Kramer told us we'll get ice cream after lunch today!

46
00:03:11.554 --> 00:03:14.726
So it looks like I'll be staying here for a while.

47
00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:18.368
Good luck with the canoe race, guys."

48
00:03:18.369 --> 00:03:25.315
"You can't do this to us!" Glen shouted. "We're a team! You have to—"

49
00:03:25.316 --> 00:03:29.439
Ivy quickly shut the window and ran back to bed.

50
00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.004
She pulled out her sketch pad again.

51
00:03:32.005 --> 00:03:37.941
"I've been busy drawing a graphic novel. Would you like to see it, Annie?"

52
00:03:37.942 --> 00:03:42.187
Annie coughed. "Uh, sure."

53
00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:47.185
Ivy handed Annie the sketch pad.

54
00:03:47.186 --> 00:03:51.433
"I still need to draw the zombies marching into Camp Nevergreen.

55
00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:54.599
But I'll show you what happens next."

56
00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:58.658
Ivy jumped on her bed and raised her arms like a zombie.

57
00:03:58.659 --> 00:04:02.465
"Hundreds of zombies invade the camp.

58
00:04:02.466 --> 00:04:08.057
They're snarling like this." She made loud snarling sounds.

59
00:04:08.058 --> 00:04:12.797
"Wow," Annie said. "That's intense."

60
00:04:12.798 --> 00:04:18.832
Ivy was so busy acting out the zombie invasion, she didn't see Nurse Kramer return.

61
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:23.080
The nurse crossed her arms. "Ahem!"

62
00:04:23.081 --> 00:04:27.749
"Oops!" Ivy dropped down onto the bed and yanked up the covers.

63
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.831
She closed her eyes and moaned loudly.

64
00:04:30.832 --> 00:04:33.959
"Forget it, Ivy," Nurse Kramer said.

65
00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:40.867
"You've made a rapid recovery. And that means, it's time for you to go!"

